d` linked to the button via `aria-labelledby`. This is the recommended way to provide a contextual label that is also visible to sighted users."],[449,"**`aria-label`** — pass `aria-label` on the `DropZone` component to override or supplement the label (e.g. `aria-label=\"Upload profile photo\"`). When no `Text slot=\"label\"` is present and no `aria-label` is set, the button falls back to the default \"DropZone\" label provided by React Aria."],[1207,"**`ButtonGroup`** — a cluster of related actions, typically inside a `Footer` (an end-aligned, wrapping row with `role=\"group\"`)."],[1204,"**`Content`** — the primary body region (a `<section>`, a column that grows to fill)."],[237,"**`FieldError`**: Displays validation error text below the group"],[1206,"**`Footer`** — the bottom region: secondary content and/or actions (a `<footer>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[1208,"**`Group`** — semantic grouping container for field item controls. A parent field injects the box chrome."],[1205,"**`Header`** — the top region: title area and optional trailing close (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[540,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[539,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[547,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[548,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[546,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[1577,"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize."],[976,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by d