roup` is composed: write `Label`, a `Group` holding the `Radio` items, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. The `Group` takes its axis, gap, and presentational role from the group's `orientation`, so a bare `<Group>` is all you need; pass your own `direction`/`gap` to lay the items out differently. Each `Radio` takes label text next to the indicator. `orientation` also sets keyboard-navigation direction and ARIA."],[1785,"`renderTooltip` example combining a pair of series. Each pair shares a `colorIndex`\n(solid actual + dashed forecast); hovering either line shows the percent change of\nthe forecast against the actual for that pair, wrapped in the default styled popover."],[1786,"`renderTooltip` example styled as a period-over-period comparison card. Paired series\n(solid current period + dashed previous period) share a `colorIndex`; hovering either\nline shows both dated values and the percent change, wrapped in the default popover."],[1784,"`renderTooltip` lets you render a fully custom tooltip and know which curve is\nhovered. Paired series share a `colorIndex`; hovering either line shows a\ntooltip specific to that line, wrapped in the default styled popover."],[807,"`role=\"dialog\"` is applied automatically by the underlying React Aria `Dialog`"],[881,"`role=\"dialog\"` is applied automatically by the underlying React Aria `Dialog`"],[414,"`role=\"dialog\"` with `aria-modal=\"true\"` on the drawer panel (via RAC Modal)"],[565,"`role=\"img\"`: When title prop is provided"],[564,"`role=\"presentation\"`: For decorative icons"],[343,"`role=\"progressbar\"` on the container"],[900,"`role=\"progressbar\"` on the container"],[1027,"`role=\"radio\"` on each option"],[1151,"`role=\"radio\"` on each segment"],[1026,"`role=\"radiogroup\"` on the container"],[1150,"`role=\"radiogroup\"` on the container"],[1522,"`selectionMode=\"multiple\"` → `role=\"toolbar\"` on container, `role=\"button\"` + `aria-pressed` per item"],[1521,"`selectionMode=\"single\"` → `rol